.*
.* QWCDSPWSU: Display Work Station User (System Request option 7,
.* DSPWSUSR): the user, the display and the interactive jobs at it,
.* A the primary and B the secondary. The empty :DATACOL. puts the
.* colon at column 45, where the golden has it.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=JOBCL BASETYPE='CHAR 28'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USRTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=WSNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WSTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=NBRJOBS CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=CURJOB CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBA CLASS=JOBCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBB CLASS=JOBCL.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP='KEYS/KEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=EXIT.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPWSUSR KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPWSUH TOPSEP=DATETIME.Display Work Station User
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=44.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/USER'.User
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=USRTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/USRTEXT'.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=WSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/WSNAME'.Work station
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=WSTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/WSTEXT'.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=NBRJOBS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NBRJOBS'.Number of interactive jobs in session
:DATAI VAR=CURJOB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURJOB'.Interactive job currently active
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBA'.Interactive job A
:DATAI VAR=JOBB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBB'.Interactive job B
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPWSUH.Display Work Station User - Help
:P.The user signed on at this display station and the interactive jobs
running at it. Job A is the first job signed on; job B is the
secondary job System Request option 1 started, *NONE while there is
none. The active job is the one the display shows now.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/KEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USER'.User
:P.The user shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRTEXT'.Text
:P.The text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/WSNAME'.Work station
:P.The work station shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/WSTEXT'.Text
:P.The text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NBRJOBS'.Number of interactive jobs in session
:P.The number of interactive jobs in session shown for what the display
is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CURJOB'.Interactive job currently active
:P.The interactive job currently active shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOBA'.Interactive job A
:P.The interactive job A shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOBB'.Interactive job B
:P.The interactive job B shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
